  "divergence_note": "Designed from a placard outward rather than from a landscape inward. The film never shows a whole rig and never stands back from one: it lives inside the fence line at hand and head height, the movement is a repeated in-and-out bite by one machine rather than a traverse across a place, and the hero is an absence, the square of steel with nobody on it. The August 18th film accumulated a building out of racks under night practical light. This one is hard noon on caliche and works by subtraction.",
